Hi dieselpunk constructors!

We’re happy to share our first update to Dieselpunk Wars. It wouldn’t be possible without your feedback - thanks to your comments on the Steam forum and your reviews we know what to focus on. It helps us improve our game a lot! Thank you!
So, without further ado, take a look at the list of improvements and bug fixes below:

💥 It's now possible to edit your vehicle during scouting missions in the Campaign;
💥 Toolbar in Creative Mode now remembers which blocks you assigned to it after you exit the game;
💥 You can now rebind the controls for adding and removing elements;
💥 You can also change keybindings that rotate your vehicle in Build Mode;
💥 Added a tooltip to the Harpoon module;
💥 You can now move your camera further away from your vehicle in Build Mode - this is especially useful for truly massive vehicles;
💥 Achievement Cut Through The Waves should now be properly awarded;
💥 Vehicles no longer take damage from hitting trees;
💥 Impact damage from terrain has been greatly reduced;
💥 Added new icons to Battle Simulator - taking control over vehicles should now be more intuitive;
💥 Selected vehicles in Battle Simulator are now highlighted;
💥 Fixed a bug which sometimes caused the camera to move while searching for a block in Module Selection Window;
💥 Rocket boosters can now be installed in more orientations to help your vehicles decelerate, turn, or lift;
💥 Race missions are now easier to complete;
💥 Side missions give bigger rewards in the Campaign Mode;
💥 On the first map of the Campaign Mode, Rudder is now unlocked when you first gain access to Gas Floater modules;
💥 Fewer enemies attack the allied base on the first map of the Campaign Mode, making the mission easier;
💥 Tweaked mission start location on the first map of the Campaign Mode to lower the downtime between missions;
💥 Slowed down skill progression in the Campaign Mode;
💥 Moved a respawn point beyond the range of enemy turrets;
💥 Fixed a glitch, which would cause enemies in a race to randomly fly away;
💥 Fixed an error in German translation, which would incorrectly display "Spielen" instead of "Verlassen";
💥 Changed Chinese translations for "Load Vehicle" and "Save Vehicle" to "保存载具" and "加载载具";
💥 Added missing translations for one of the wheels;
💥 Side missions where the player has to run from powerful enemies are now significantly easier;
💥 Added a new part - a small rocket engine. It doesn't generate as much heat as the bigger version and it should be perfect for making those tight maneuvers!

Please don’t hesitate to keep leaving us feedback on the Steam forum and in your Steam reviews. Help us improve Dieselpunk Wars!

Thank you for playing!

Cheers,
Image Power Team

